OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly dry with only a small
OL,7,Fchance of the odd light shower at
OL,8,Ffirst. The night will then stay dry
OL,9,Fwith increasing clear periods.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,12,Fspells in the morning, though somewhat
OL,13,Fcloudier around Fife and Tayside. The
OL,14,Fafternoon will stay dry but sunshine
OL,15,Fturning more hazy as cloud spreads
OL,16,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
