OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart on Monday, outbreaks of locally
OL,7,Fheavy rain spread east later. Bright
OL,8,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,9,FTuesday. Showers fade early Wednesday,
OL,10,Fthen rain spreads east in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
